# Root-level ignores for the monorepo (module dirs keep their own .gitignore)

# Build artifacts
*.exe
# `go build -o foo.exe` keeps a backup when foo.exe is still running
*.exe~
*.test
*.out
/dist/
/build/
# docs/ is tracked (roadmap, MCP and JSON-schema docs)

# Agent/IDE local state
.claude/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
